{
  "title": "Zesty Light Ethiopian Mincemeat Skillet",
  "description": "A diabetic-friendly Ethiopian dish featuring mincemeat, this recipe is a bitter, aerated, and light skillet meal, perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
  "diet": [
